<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title></title>

    <style>
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background: #fff;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        color: #000;
        font-size: 12px;
      }

      /* A4 page – tuned for print/PDF */
      .page {
        width: 794px;          /* A4 width @96dpi */
        min-height: 1123px;    /* A4 height */
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 28px 36px;
        position: relative;
      }

      /* Faint centre watermark */
      .watermark {
        position: absolute;
        top: 230px;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
        opacity: 0.06;
        width: 260px;
        z-index: 0;
      }

      .printing-date {
        text-align: right;
        font-size: 10px;
        margin-bottom: 4px;
      }

      /* Header row */
      .header {
        display: table;
        width: 100%;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
      }

      .header-cell {
        display: table-cell;
        vertical-align: top;
      }

      .header-logo {
        width: 22%;
      }

      .header-logo img {
        width: 90px;
        height: auto;
      }

      .header-center {
        width: 56%;
        text-align: center;
        line-height: 1.3;
      }

      .header-center .gov {
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: bold;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .header-center .form {
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: bold;
      }

      .header-center .rule {
        font-size: 11px;
        margin-top: 2px;
      }

      .header-center .auth {
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin-top: 2px;
      }

      .header-qr {
        width: 22%;
        text-align: right;
      }

      .header-qr img {
        width: 120px;
        height: 120px;
        object-fit: contain;
      }

      /* Main details table (2 columns x 2) */
      table.kv {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
      }

      table.kv td {
        padding: 2px 2px;
        vertical-align: top;
      }

      table.kv td.label {
        width: 18%;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }

      table.kv td.value {
        width: 32%;
        font-weight: bold;
      }

      .body-text {
        margin-top: 4px;
        font-size: 11px;
        text-align: justify;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
      }

      /* Secondary info table */
      table.mini {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        margin-top: 6px;
        font-size: 11px;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
      }

      table.mini td {
        padding: 2px 2px;
        vertical-align: top;
      }

      table.mini td.label {
        width: 18%;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }

      table.mini td.value {
        width: 32%;
        font-weight: bold;
      }

      .small-text {
        margin-top: 6px;
        font-size: 10px;
        text-align: justify;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
      }

      /* Tax table with blue border like PDF */
      table.tax {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        margin-top: 14px;
        font-size: 11px;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
      }

      table.tax th,
      table.tax td {
        border: 1px solid #0070c0;
        padding: 4px 6px;
      }

      table.tax th {
        text-align: center;
        font-weight: bold;
      }

      table.tax td {
        text-align: left;
      }

      table.tax td.num {
        text-align: right;
        width: 10%;
      }

      .grand-total {
        margin-top: 6px;
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: bold;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
      }

      .note-small {
        margin-top: 6px;
        font-size: 10px;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
      }

      .terms-title {
        font-weight: bold;
        margin-top: 4px;
        margin-bottom: 2px;
      }

      .terms-list {
        margin: 0 0 0 16px;
        padding: 0;
      }

      .terms-list li {
        margin-bottom: 2px;
      }

      /* Big bold bottom note */
      .bottom-note {
        margin-top: 10px;
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: bold;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
      }

      .bottom-note-url {
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: normal;
        margin-top: 2px;
      }

      .bottom-note-url a {
        color: #0070c0;
        text-decoration: underline;
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="page">
      <% if (data.watermarkSrc) { %>
        <img src="<%= data.watermarkSrc %>" class="watermark" alt="Watermark" />
      <% } %>

      <% if (data.receiptPrintingDate) { %>
        <div class="printing-date">
          Receipt Printing Date:
          <br />
          <%= data.receiptPrintingDate %>
        </div>
      <% } %>

      <div class="header">
        <div class="header-cell header-logo">
          <img src="<%= data.logoSrc || '/images1/Puducherry.png' %>" alt="Logo" />
        </div>

        <div class="header-cell header-center">
          <div class="gov">GOVERNMENT OF PUDUCHERRY</div>
          <div class="form">FORM P.Temp</div>
          <div class="rule">[See rule 61(1)(iv)]</div>
          <div class="auth">THE STATE TRANSPORT AUTHORITY, PUDUCHERRY</div>
        </div>

        <div class="header-cell header-qr">
          <img src="<%= data.qrSrc %>" alt="QR Code" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Main details (left-right columns) -->
      <table class="kv">
        <tr>
          <td class="label">Registration No.</td>
          <td class="value">: <%= data.vehicleNo %></td>
          <td class="label">Receipt No.</td>
          <td class="value">: <%= data.receiptNo %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="label">Payment Date</td>
          <td class="value">: <%= data.paymentDate %></td>
          <td class="label">Owner Name.</td>
          <td class="value">: <%= data.ownerName %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="label">Chassis No.</td>
          <td class="value">: <%= data.chassisNo %></td>
          <td class="label">TaxMode</td>
          <td class="value">: <%= data.taxMode %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="label">Vehicle Type</td>
          <td class="value">: <%= data.vehicleType %></td>
          <td class="label">Vehicle Class</td>
          <td class="value">: <%= data.vehicleClass %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="label">Vehicle Category</td>
          <td class="value">: <%= data.vehicleCategory %></td>
          <td class="label">Mobile No.</td>
          <td class="value">: <%= data.mobileNo %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="label">CheckPost Name</td>
          <td class="value">: <%= data.checkPostName %></td>
          <td class="label">Seating Capacity</td>
          <td class="value">: <%= data.seatingCapacity %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="label">Sleeper Cap</td>
          <td class="value">: <%= data.sleeperCap %></td>
          <td class="label">Payment Mode</td>
          <td class="value">: <%= data.paymentMode %></td>
        </tr>
      </table>

      <div class="body-text">
        This permit shall be subject to all rules relating to Permits made under the Motor Vehicles Act, 1988 and in
        force for the time being.
      </div>

      <table class="mini">
        <tr>
          <td class="label">Bank Ref. No.</td>
          <td class="value">: <%= data.bankRefNo %></td>
          <td class="label">Permit Validity</td>
          <td class="value">: <%= data.permitValidity %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="label">Fitness Validity</td>
          <td class="value">: <%= data.fitnessValidity %></td>
          <td class="label">Insurance Validity</td>
          <td class="value">: <%= data.insuranceValidity %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="label">Service Type</td>
          <td class="value">: <%= data.serviceType %></td>
          <td class="label">Permit Type</td>
          <td class="value">: <%= data.permitType %></td>
        </tr>
      </table>

      <div class="small-text">
        Under the provision of sub-section(4) of section 89 of Act and with the particular consent of the Transport
        Authority concerned. This Permit is valid for --
        <%= data.validDays %>
        Days only.
      </div>

      <table class="tax">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Tax/Fee Particular</th>
            <th>Tax/Fees</th>
            <th>Fine</th>
            <th>Total</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>MV Tax ( <%= data.mvTaxFrom %> To <%= data.mvTaxTo %> )</td>
            <td class="num"><%= data.mvTaxAmount %></td>
            <td class="num"><%= data.mvTaxFine %></td>
            <td class="num"><%= data.mvTaxTotal %></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Service/User Charge ( <%= data.serviceFrom %> To <%= data.serviceTo %> )</td>
            <td class="num"><%= data.serviceAmount %></td>
            <td class="num"><%= data.serviceFine %></td>
            <td class="num"><%= data.serviceTotal %></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <div class="grand-total">
        Grand Total : <%= data.grandTotal %>/- <%= data.grandTotalWords %> Only
      </div>

      <div class="note-small">
        <b>Note :</b>
      </div>
      <div class="note-small">
        <span class="terms-title">Terms and Conditions:</span>
        <ol class="terms-list">
          <li>This is a computer generated printout and no signature is required.</li>
          <li>
            Incorrect mentioning of vehicle class or seating capacity may lead to tax evasion and defaulter shall be
            liable for penal action.
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="bottom-note">
        Note : This document is generated from testing Server and has no legal or official value.
      </div>
      <div class="bottom-note-url">
        Scan the QR code for genuinity of the receipt, It should land at
        <a href="https://kms.parivahan.gov.in">https://kms.parivahan.gov.in</a> site. In case the URL is different,
        then receipt could be a fake one, please raise a complain.
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
